# Greyhold Chronicle

Imports the Lost Chalice quest as an opaque handle. The chronicler never
sees Party, Adventurer, or Hoard — only Public methods on Quest.

## Import

```
[[importA]] as realm
```

## Schema

```
Chronicle = String/scribe @Quest
```

## Construction

```
[:Chronicle "Greyhold" realm.make("The Lost Chalice", "Andy the Adventurer", "Dodgy Dave")]
```

## Methods

```
Chronicle::report = { scribe.concat(" records ").concat(quest.headline()).concat(" — ").concat(quest.roster()) }

Chronicle::purse = { quest.gold() }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var chronicle = ChronicleAssemblage.factory();
    trace(chronicle.report());
    trace(chronicle.purse());
}
```
